  "duration": 39.8,
  "loop": true,
  "vo": "This envelope takes thirty months to fill. Yours too. Median paycheck, every two weeks, after tax: two thousand ninety-four. Half goes in MUST: ten forty-seven. Ten percent? Move the decimal: two oh nine. Half that is OOPS: a hundred five. Ten plus five, FUTURE: three fourteen. What's left is FUN: six twenty-eight. Now time the OOPS envelope. Goal: three months of MUST. That's a hundred fifty percent of a month's pay. It gets five percent a month. A hundred fifty over five: thirty months. Sixty-five paychecks. Notice: no paycheck anywhere in that math. Median, nurse, minimum wage: thirty months. A bigger paycheck doesn't fill it faster. Six months of cushion? Sixty months.",
  "captions": [
    {"t": 0.2, "end": 2.8, "text": "This envelope takes 30 months to fill. Yours too.", "say": "This envelope takes thirty months to fill. Yours too."},
    {"t": 2.9, "end": 4.5, "text": "Median paycheck, every 2 weeks,", "say": "Median paycheck, every two weeks,"},
    {"t": 4.6, "end": 5.9, "text": "after tax: $2,094.", "say": "after tax: two thousand ninety-four."},
    {"t": 6.0, "end": 7.9, "text": "Half goes in MUST: $1,047.", "say": "Half goes in MUST: ten forty-seven."},
    {"t": 8.0, "end": 10.2, "text": "10%? Move the decimal: $209.", "say": "Ten percent? Move the decimal: two oh nine."},
    {"t": 10.3, "end": 12.4, "text": "Half that is OOPS: $105.", "say": "Half that is OOPS: a hundred five."},
    {"t": 12.5, "end": 14.4, "text": "10 plus 5, FUTURE: $314.", "say": "Ten plus five, FUTURE: three fourteen."},
    {"t": 14.5, "end": 16.4, "text": "What's left is FUN: $628.", "say": "What's left is FUN: six twenty-eight."},
    {"t": 16.8, "end": 18.4, "text": "Now time the OOPS envelope."},
    {"t": 18.5, "end": 20.1, "text": "Goal: 3 months of MUST.", "say": "Goal: three months of MUST."},
    {"t": 20.2, "end": 22.4, "text": "That's 150% of a month's pay.", "say": "That's a hundred fifty percent of a month's pay."},
    {"t": 22.5, "end": 24.4, "text": "It gets 5% a month.", "say": "It gets five percent a month."},
    {"t": 24.5, "end": 26.6, "text": "150 over 5: 30 months.", "say": "A hundred fifty over five: thirty months."},
    {"t": 26.7, "end": 27.8, "text": "65 paychecks.", "say": "Sixty-five paychecks."},
    {"t": 27.9, "end": 30.1, "text": "Notice: no paycheck anywhere in that math."},
    {"t": 30.6, "end": 33.1, "text": "Median, nurse, minimum wage: 30 months.", "say": "Median, nurse, minimum wage: thirty months."},
    {"t": 33.2, "end": 35.3, "text": "A bigger paycheck doesn't fill it faster."},
    {"t": 35.9, "end": 37.6, "text": "6 months of cushion?", "say": "Six months of cushion?"},
    {"t": 37.7, "end": 39.4, "text": "60 months.", "say": "Sixty months."}
